<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<project>
  <fileVersion>
    <major>6</major>
    <minor>9</minor>
    <build>0</build>
  </fileVersion>
  <title>TurboExo ADS1115 compact carrier Rev D</title>
  <author>TurboExo</author>
  <description>REV D SENSOR FIRST: reserved wake pads EMPTY and UNWIRED. Do not fit wake parts or leads. 24x18 individual pad board. TOP coordinate view. Colored wires are insulated underneath; bends/crossings are not soldered. P_BUS and G_BUS segments form bare continuous buses joined only at listed taps. F1/F2 pads are bypassed with fitted removable links; R3, C1, C2 empty. J5/J6/J7/R7/R8/C6/D1 are bare reserved pads, unwired; no wake function or external wake leads. No formal HAT compliance. Physical fit and electrical tests not performed. See guide.</description>
